Just a quick note on the translations: translating individual words between German, English, and Spanish can be tricky. Some words don’t have perfect one-to-one equivalents, and meanings can shift depending on context. I’ve tried to keep the translations as accurate and useful as possible, but there may be occasional mismatches. In the future, I’m considering adding a Spanish definition field to help clarify meanings even further.
